\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p><em>after we die, where do we go? <br />back into the universe. part of the stars.<br />so can we share a single star? <br />we’ll each have our own star, he said. then we can chase each other around. <br />but I don’t want to be lost in space without you. I said. <br />you won’t be. we’ll orbit together. <br />always? <br />yes, always. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n\n\n  <p>💌 receive my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/letters\">letters</a><br /> 📓 more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-diaries\" target=\"_blank\">visual diaries</a><br />🌸 more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a><br /></p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"5dc4c177d6b2e335022538ae37b4dbcb84f32b6fcabef1998df50c905daeffce","category":"Sites"}